</ul><p>Please check before you start with a new translation in the <a title="Localisation Section of the RawTherapee Forum" href="http://www.rawtherapee.com/forum/viewforum.php?f=4">Localisation Forum</a> if someone else already started with the same language and post there if you start to translate something.</p>
<p>If you have translated the manual to a new language, please send the result to localisation at rawtherapee dot com. This way it can be provided here for public download.</p></div>

